                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c74e36bb-1c0e-3313-88f2-56e6c15cb404",
                        "entry_id": "02863278-7e30-38d5-989a-1e79176a9895",
                        "glosses": [
                            "оркестр или ансамбль, исполняющий джаз"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1854333f-43df-4a62-98ce-4fe45561da2b",
                                "sense_id": "c74e36bb-1c0e-3313-88f2-56e6c15cb404",
                                "text": "Оркестр, не считая дирижёра, составился из десяти человек: три саксофона (два альта и тенор), две трубы, тромбон, рояль, контрабас, ударная группа и банджо. Именно таков и был обычный состав западного джаз-банда."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "26a3dfaa-8017-4d90-89f9-3af55bd7229e",
                        "source_entry_id": "02863278-7e30-38d5-989a-1e79176a9895",
                        "source_sense_id": "c74e36bb-1c0e-3313-88f2-56e6c15cb404",
                        "target_lang_word": "jazz",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jazz",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3aa2a9e-f6fc-3caf-b413-a637c5d74acc",
                                        "entry_id": "c061d6a8-c36c-3a04-b359-cfb27a4b0a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A musical art form rooted in West African cultural and musical expression and in the African American blues tradition, with diverse influences over time, commonly characterized by blue notes, syncopation, swing, call and response, polyrhythms and improvisation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "118c5c93-3a5d-4f6f-a438-b7f10389065c",
                                                "sense_id": "d3aa2a9e-f6fc-3caf-b413-a637c5d74acc",
                                                "text": "You dare to bring your jazz songs into my house!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec55120a-5a62-4bdd-95da-3034132a81a2",
                                                "sense_id": "d3aa2a9e-f6fc-3caf-b413-a637c5d74acc",
                                                "text": "You all look out now, here I come, everybody step aside, I’m gonna show you where from! I'm gonna blow in this horn and make you know that jazz is the king and let it be so!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44d0a5b2-bd54-4965-8cad-ae5a9c9d46a6",
                                                "sense_id": "d3aa2a9e-f6fc-3caf-b413-a637c5d74acc",
                                                "text": "You see, the kids, they listen to the rap music which gives them the brain damage. With their hippin', and the hoppin', and the bippin', and the boppin', so they don't know what the jazz…is all about! You see, jazz is like the Jello Pudding Pop—no, actually, it's more like Kodak film—no, actually, jazz is like the New Coke: it'll be around forever, heh heh."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed77970e-0bc9-37ed-8fa4-8bd5d82a4fe6",
                                        "entry_id": "c061d6a8-c36c-3a04-b359-cfb27a4b0a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Energy, excitement, excitability."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b95d4d50-82a8-4d1b-bfee-f41ad0745bd8",
                                                "sense_id": "ed77970e-0bc9-37ed-8fa4-8bd5d82a4fe6",
                                                "text": "“You want something zippy there. Something with a bit of jazz to it!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "983fda60-72a5-40c4-becb-aad26a63091a",
                                                "sense_id": "ed77970e-0bc9-37ed-8fa4-8bd5d82a4fe6",
                                                "text": "He loves the risk. The danger. He loves the jazz."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f8b7a06-a8df-354c-b16b-bd1f2c6ec01d",
                                        "entry_id": "c061d6a8-c36c-3a04-b359-cfb27a4b0a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The substance or makeup of a thing; unspecified thing(s)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffac5a3d-62b7-430c-a545-60e6a778da32",
                                                "sense_id": "2f8b7a06-a8df-354c-b16b-bd1f2c6ec01d",
                                                "text": "and all that jazz"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbf3c756-8ee1-4082-acca-2769bc55478d",
                                                "sense_id": "2f8b7a06-a8df-354c-b16b-bd1f2c6ec01d",
                                                "text": "What is all this jazz lying around?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80977566-6194-48b4-ab76-605bfa3873b9",
                                                "sense_id": "2f8b7a06-a8df-354c-b16b-bd1f2c6ec01d",
                                                "text": "I'm just going down to the shops and jazz."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "decd3e80-d631-4009-8a75-43d32b7ce9b3",
                                                "sense_id": "2f8b7a06-a8df-354c-b16b-bd1f2c6ec01d",
                                                "text": "Dad, I want to be a jock. All a jock needs is some hep patter and a real gone image. Now, they just don't teach that jazz in college."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75220a9b-d5e9-31a7-94f5-0adb60a9d082",
                                        "entry_id": "c061d6a8-c36c-3a04-b359-cfb27a4b0a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something of excellent quality, the genuine article."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d84266dd-884e-48e5-9834-b72b3797a35c",
                                                "sense_id": "75220a9b-d5e9-31a7-94f5-0adb60a9d082",
                                                "text": "That show was the jazz!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc9f39c3-4e6e-4948-b2b1-a60c4b72f05a",
                                                "sense_id": "75220a9b-d5e9-31a7-94f5-0adb60a9d082",
                                                "text": "This risotto is simply the jazz."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4f99437-4cf8-3a69-89bc-e0c2d5461c2c",
                                        "entry_id": "c061d6a8-c36c-3a04-b359-cfb27a4b0a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nonsense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1719ea1-340d-4f11-8761-bc4e0cb8fe6b",
                                                "sense_id": "c4f99437-4cf8-3a69-89bc-e0c2d5461c2c",
                                                "text": "Stop talking jazz."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50ed4069-4d83-3d57-be09-97333b4b9259",
                                        "entry_id": "c061d6a8-c36c-3a04-b359-cfb27a4b0a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Semen, jizz."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7aab68d5-f5f1-4817-8094-26d40b52c9ea",
                                                "sense_id": "50ed4069-4d83-3d57-be09-97333b4b9259",
                                                "text": "Suddenly, Bobby oozed his jazz into Gene's throat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa31789b-455e-4d2e-a396-e21a44205879",
                                                "sense_id": "50ed4069-4d83-3d57-be09-97333b4b9259",
                                                "text": "[…] making Glenn feel as though he could never stop shooting his jazz wildly up inside the man's brawny body!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d61ac4e-7312-4590-b6d8-7d535b27359f",
                                                "sense_id": "50ed4069-4d83-3d57-be09-97333b4b9259",
                                                "text": "As he clung to the legs of his captor, he splayed his own out to the side, baring his groin and genitals to the eyes of all just as his jazz began to spurt out onto the stage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a11c844-cb27-3514-9c7d-b4b7852bf3b3",
                                        "entry_id": "c061d6a8-c36c-3a04-b359-cfb27a4b0a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A red-skinned variety of eating apple."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "jazz",
